  "body": "\ud83d\udcd6 Documentation for this release: https://kvcache-ai.github.io/AgentENV/v0.2.4/\n\n---\n\n### Features\n\n- Add sandbox logs API ([#338](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/338)) \u2014 **@zlzGithub-0801**\n- Add concurrent sandbox throughput benchmarks ([#337](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/337)) \u2014 **@GxmzG**\n- Build and publish reusable images with the CLI ([#347](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/347)) \u2014 **@Primary33**\n- Add fromImageRegistry field to TemplateBuildStartV2 ([#385](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/385)) \u2014 **@zlzGithub-0801**\n- Persist source sandbox user metadata in published snapshot records ([#397](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/397)) \u2014 **@blahgeek**\n- Add DELETE /snapshots/{snapshotID} endpoint ([#396](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/396)) \u2014 **@blahgeek**\n- **custom-extension**: Surface hook 4xx/5xx status to API callers ([#395](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/395)) \u2014 **@blahgeek**\n- **overlaybd**: Add runtime cache limits and mmap-aware eviction ([#345](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/345)) \u2014 **@huang-jl**\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Restore Clippy compatibility with Rust 1.99 ([#336](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/336)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **overlaybd**: Reclaim cache capacity pinned by open entries ([#344](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/344)) \u2014 **@huajq**\n- **aenv**: Preserve queued input during recovery \u2014 **@Boulea7**\n- **firecracker**: Wait for the API socket to accept connections \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **build**: Treat a reaped BuildKit daemon as stopped \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **envd**: Lock /etc/passwd when adding a Dockerfile USER account ([#355](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/355)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **gateway**: Match node API sandbox list cursors via shared vectors ([#375](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/375)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **repository**: Create absent OSS objects with if_not_exists \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **repository**: Serialize OSS document writers with a lease on Alibaba OSS \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **proxy**: Separate HTTP and WS response header timeouts ([#377](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/377)) \u2014 **@LSX-s-Software**\n- **image**: Validate OCI blob digest before building the host path \u2014 **@aeonframework**\n- **repository**: Back off when an OSS document changes while being read ([#383](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/383)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **image**: Map zero-layer OCI manifest to 4xx ([#394](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/394)) \u2014 **@Riatre**\n- **gateway**: Size reverse proxy idle connection pools for node fan-out ([#393](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/393)) \u2014 **@blahgeek**\n- **scripts**: Forward environment explicitly for sudo-rs compatibility ([#399](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/399)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- Reject explicit volume mounts on snapshots with volumes ([#405](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/405)) \u2014 **@Primary33**\n- **sandbox**: Announce guest MAC changes via arp_notify ([#409](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/409)) \u2014 **@dushulin**\n- **overlaybd**: Reconcile mmap limits with open-entry eviction ([#423](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/423)) \u2014 **@huang-jl**\n- **sandbox**: Hide image refs from guest metadata ([#419](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/419)) \u2014 **@Riatre**\n- **storage**: Avoid spurious ZFile and disk size warnings ([#420](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/420)) \u2014 **@guozy18**\n\n### Improvements\n\n- **repository**: Store build logs and cache state as shared documents ([#367](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/367)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **gateway**: Route sandbox and build paths from one table \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- Move the durable repository out of the snapshot module ([#368](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/368)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **volume**: Implement the volume catalog once on repository documents ([#369](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/369)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **snapshot**: Implement the snapshot catalog once on repository documents \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **snapshot**: Move registry export and recontainerization out of the repository \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **snapshot**: Store snapshot and volume layers through one shared pipeline \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **snapshot**: Resolve snapshots and volume backings with one resolver \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **repository**: Name every blob path in the repository layout ([#370](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/370)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **sandbox**: Reach guest envd through one backend method ([#374](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/374)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **repository**: Stop depending on snapshot, image, volume and sandbox ([#382](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/382)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- Break the dependency cycles between top-level modules \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **sandbox**: Own Firecracker host resources in SandboxResources \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **sandbox**: Share Firecracker rootfs attach and boot-arg append \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **sandbox**: Split Firecracker start_resume into stages \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- **sandbox**: Move guest volume helpers out of FirecrackerSandbox ([#380](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/380)) \u2014 **@yingdi-shan**\n- Move layer references and volume backing out of snapshot ([#386](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/386)) \u2014 **@Primary33**\n\n### Performance\n\n- **setup**: Default ublk block devices to the none I/O scheduler ([#334](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/334))\n- **ublk-daemon**: Stop devices concurrently on shutdown ([#335](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/335))\n\n### Observability\n\n- Bound the heartbeat channel's connect attempt ([#339](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/339)) \u2014 **@nblintao**\n- Log why a heartbeat failed ([#340](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/AgentENV/pull/340)) \u2014 **@nblintao**\n\n\n",
